                "title": "Egg Knob with Arched Rosette",
                "description": "The Egg Knob with Arched Rosette is a traditionally styled knobset made out of sandcast bronze. It is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Egg Knob with Arch # 1 Rosette is suitable for interior doors needing privacy, passage, or dummy functions. Emteck's Egg Knobset with #1 Rosette will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
